31:/// (see [AgentService.relayBase]); every chat surface member is overridden.
32:///
33:/// v1 limits (issue #34): the trajectory ledger stays empty (the panel
34:/// should hide the tab via `FaChatFeatures`). Approval *mode* is owned by
35:/// the SW gate: settings snapshots forward it into the local shell (issue
36:/// #380) so the selector/dialog mirror the real gate, and panel toggles
37:/// write through via `settings_put`. Attachment staging is NO LONGER one
38:/// of them (issue #313):
39:/// `stageAttachment` rides the id-matched `agent.stageUpload` ext_request
40:/// op into the SW-local sandbox, with the app's exact semantics (shared
41:/// core helper). Binary-heavy flows (real file pickers with huge files)
42:/// stay a #34 phase-2 topic; text pastes and normal attachments do not.
